DeepDoc (deepdoc/)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The deepdoc/ directory is derived from DeepDoc, part of RAGFlow
(https://github.com/infiniflow/ragflow):

    Copyright 2024-2025 The InfiniFlow Authors. All Rights Reserved.

It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see deepdoc/LICENSE),
not under the MIT License. Files carrying The InfiniFlow Authors' copyright
header come from RAGFlow and may have been modified for RagNex; the changes are
recorded in this repository's history. deepdoc/common/, deepdoc/nlp/ and
deepdoc/parser/pdf_parser.py were written for RagNex to replace RAGFlow
internals, and are provided under the Apache License, Version 2.0 as part of
deepdoc/.

When OCR or layout recognition is enabled, DeepDoc downloads model files from
the InfiniFlow/deepdoc repository on Hugging Face at runtime. They are not part
of this repository and are covered by the terms published with them.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Chunking templates
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The General, Laws and Paper chunking templates (backend/app/services/chunking/)
reimplement the behaviour of RAGFlow's templates of the same names, for
compatibility. They are written for RagNex and licensed under the MIT License.

